  "notes": "Single 'MA Fee' column (population 'all'). Codes marked '*' require a Benefit Limit Exception for individuals 21 and older unless they reside in a NF or ICF: D2740, D2751, D3310, D3320, D3330, D4341, D4342, D4355, D4910. Age limits printed in Limits column: D1110 12 years and older only; D1120 under 12 only; D1206, D1351, D2930, D3220, D9230 under 21 only; D8080 under 21 only; D8670 and D8680 'under 23 years of age only' (as printed). Radiographs: maximum allowance for any combination of dental radiographs per patient per provider per calendar year is $69.00. Crowns: only D2740 and D2751 of the requested crown codes are listed. Not in schedule (omitted): D2750, D2752, D2790, D2950, D2962, D3346-D3348, D5225/D5226, D5820/D5821, implants D6010-D6066, fixed bridge D6240-D6790, D7241, D7953, D8070, D8090. Adults 21+: diagnostic/preventive limited to 1 per 180 days; endodontics, crowns and periodontal services require an approved BLE (per DHS dental provider page). Most PA MA members are in HealthChoices managed care; this is the FFS schedule.",
